# fri3 (FRI3) removed: it loads its WASM via fetch() against res://, which the
# stock engine's scheme registration doesn't allow (needs FetchEnabled), so it
# fails silently for launcher clients too. Re-add only if we ship an engine that
# enables fetch on res://.
